**additional view = the view that is displayed under the cc when it is in its smaller size

Bugs:
- notification filtering not working sometimes
- cc music player not closing when tapping
- needs blurred bg for when opening expanded cc modules
- fix scroll view not having a large enough content size for notifs
- fix not all notifications showing until you start to scroll
- screen recording module not syncing across different cc's
- fix animations in cc

Features:
- show ls music player in additional view area
- horizontal scroll view to switch between additional views
- option to constantly have scroll view in miniature size
- custom control center different from the normal one (select whichever modules you want to show respectively from the main cc)
